  m_Name: Forest_Campfire_6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Forest_Campfire_6
  headerName: The Abandoned House
  content: "\tWe found a house up the slope, deserted and unlocked. Whoever lived
    there left in such a hurry that they abandoned almost everything \u2014 food,
    medicine, warmth. We rested there.\r\n\t\n\tIt is remarkable what a warm bed
    and a place that feels safe can do to tired bones. The exhaustion simply lifted.
    But we couldn't stay. We set out again the next morning, carrying only hope:
    that the Lighthouse would be safer than this. That there would be more food.
    More water. That it would be enough.\r\n\n\tWe had only that. But we held it."
  type: 0
  biome: 0
  icon: {fileID: 0}
